	// (`PRIMITIVE_WEBHOOK_SECRET`, `PRIMITIVE_API_KEY`,
	// `PRIMITIVE_API_BASE_URL`) already bound. Add user-set secrets via
	// `POST /functions/{id}/secrets`; secret writes only land in the
	// running handler on the next redeploy.
